  "title": "AECOM strengthens Aviation Architecture capability in the UK and Europe with senior industry appointment",
  "summary": "Appointment supports AECOM’s continued growth across major aviation programmes throughout the region LONDON (16 July, 2026) — AECOM, the trusted global infrastructure leader, has appointed Dennis Austin as Aviation Architecture Director, strengthening its aviation architecture capability as the company continues to expand its support for major airport programmes across the UK and Europe. With more...",
